 * Invariants:
 *   R1 triggers — the AI Teammate stub (and its per-repo template) declare
 *      EXACTLY issues + workflow_dispatch. A push trigger here would launch
 *      teammate runs on every state push; a dropped trigger silently kills
 *      the machine loop.
